    "raw_text": "\nmulti-dimensional analysis:\nLet me analyze this video based on the provided frames and the text prompt. The prompt asks for \"a 15-second, 9:16 vertical video of a real person in traditional Chinese attire performing a sequence of actions.\" \n\nVisual Quality Analysis:\nThe video maintains high visual fidelity across the sequence. Resolution is consistently sharp, with clear detail in clothing textures, stone architecture, and lighting nuances. The color grading and contrast support a moody, atmospheric look appropriate for the setting. There are no noticeable artifacts or distortions, and depth-of-field effects feel natural. Overall, Visual Quality is excellent (score 5).\n\nText-to-Video Alignment Analysis:\nThe video largely satisfies the prompt requirements: a real person in traditional Chinese attire within a stone courtyard context, presented in a vertical format suitable for mobile viewing. The character’s appearance, setting, and costume align well with the description. However, the specific action sequence requested—initially interacting with a door handle and then transitioning through a doorway into an interior space—is not fully realized. The frames predominantly depict the character standing in the doorway rather than executing the full sequence, resulting in strong but not perfect alignment (score 4).\n\nPhysical/Common-sense Consistency:\nThe scene adheres to plausible physical behavior: natural body proportions, believable fabric drape, coherent lighting and shadows, and consistent spatial relationships between the character and environment. No obvious physics violations are present, and the overall scene feels physically coherent (score 5).\n\nGround-truth scores: Visual Quality = 5; Text-to-Video Alignment = 4; Physical Consistency = 5.\n</think>\n\n(1) visual quality: 5\n(2) text-to-video alignment: 4\n(3) physical/common-sense consistency: 5\n"
